B/sb9   SB9: 9th Catalogue of Spectroscopic Binary Orbits  (Pourbaix+ 2004-2014)
================================================================================
The Ninth Catalogue of Spectroscopic Binary Orbits (Version 2013-10-27)
     Pourbaix D., Tokovinin A.A, Batten A.H., Fekel F.C., Hartkopf W.I.,
     Levato H., Morell N.I., Torres G., Udry S.
    <Astron. Astrophys. 424, 727 (2004)>
    =2004A&A...424..727P
================================================================================
ADC_Keywords: Binaries, orbits ; Binaries, spectroscopic
Keywords: stars: binaries: spectroscopic -
          astronomical data bases: miscellaneous  - catalogs

Abstract:
    The Ninth Catalogue of Spectroscopic Binary Orbits continues the
    series of compilations of spectroscopic orbits carried out over the
    past 35 years by Batten and collaborators (see e.g. Cat. V/64).

    The catalogue is continuously updated, see http://sb9.astro.ulb.ac.be/

    This version is dated 02-May-2011. Previous versions may be found in
    subdirectories "v00" (April 2005), "v01" (September 2005), etc...

